{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Goopmaxxing is a dark comedy sandbox story about brewing <strong>bizarre potions</strong> and <strong>experimenting</strong> on unfortunate <strong>goblin specimens</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does the goblin look sad because you turned it into a <strong>disgusting abomination</strong>? Just drop it into <strong>the meat grinder</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every item</strong> in Goblin Goopmaxxing can be brewed into a potion with a <strong>completely unique effect</strong>. Want to turn a <strong>goblin body-pillow</strong> into a potion? Go ahead! I don't know what it'll do, but it'll probably disfigure the goblin in horrifying ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/74428623756cf81f705b120077174adc.webp?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/18829888e0c921b93320502742d6490e.poster.avif?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/18829888e0c921b93320502742d6490e.webm?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/18829888e0c921b93320502742d6490e.mp4?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A sausage potion that grows a <strong>third leg</strong>? A chair potion that turns the goblin into a chair goblin? A goblin <strong>baby potion</strong> that does another crazy thing that you'll just have to find out when you play Goblin Goopmaxxing?! The <strong>possibilities are endless</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/faf4d8996b24910c5e37ac4b2d8fee8e.webp?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/6ab30b2bba80022a3bb4f0762047b3a6.poster.avif?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/6ab30b2bba80022a3bb4f0762047b3a6.webm?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/6ab30b2bba80022a3bb4f0762047b3a6.mp4?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Potions interact with each other in ways that you never expected, turning the once pristine looking goblin specimen into a <strong>horribly disfigured monster</strong>. If it doesn't meet the collectors requirements, just drop it in the meat grinder! Maybe <strong>hit it with a flail</strong> 100 times before that! Or <strong>shoot it with an AK-47</strong>! Did I tell you you can shoot an <strong>AK-47</strong> in Goblin Goopmaxxing? Now you know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/e9987a5f5097f3ccf82972e9e0e85f4c.webp?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/4bd998d67d25d2327b049c7d9f7526dd.poster.avif?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/4bd998d67d25d2327b049c7d9f7526dd.webm?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/4bd998d67d25d2327b049c7d9f7526dd.mp4?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Goblins don't have rights</strong> so you can do what you want with them! If you're feeling hungry why don't you <strong>throw a gnome into a woodchipper</strong> to turn him into a sausage? You can in Goblin Goopmaxxing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/312b8cfdf9e61905038f1af2f7fdf519.webp?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/160dad62f11a5c3c24630c0a5079bce8.poster.avif?t=1762479176\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/160dad62f11a5c3c24630c0a5079bce8.webm?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107470/extras/160dad62f11a5c3c24630c0a5079bce8.mp4?t=1762479176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do as the collector says, <strong>you don't want to make him mad</strong>, do you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I rate this game G